{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/app/server-functions","title":"Public and protected server functions","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"public-and-protected-server-functions","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Public and protected server functions"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"serverFunction"},{"t":"text","text":" is a transport contract. Authentication and authorization are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"middleware concerns: do not add an "},{"t":"code","text":"access: 'admin'"},{"t":"text","text":" option or a parallel"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"protectedServerFunction"},{"t":"text","text":" helper."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-canonical-path","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The canonical path"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"client middleware"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  → handshake / client context"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  → existing server middleware"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  → verified session and role"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  → server-function handler"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  → Effect service and Layer"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The browser may announce an identifier through "},{"t":"code","text":"clientContext"},{"t":"text","text":", but that value"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is untrusted. The server must load the session again and compare the claim with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the verified identity. A missing, expired or revoked session must stop the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"middleware chain before the handler runs."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"transport-failures","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Transport failures"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every client-side server-function transport failure is returned as a typed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"HttpError"},{"t":"text","text":", including a lost connection, an aborted request, an unavailable"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":" implementation or an unreadable response. Network failures use"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"status: 0"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"statusText: 'Unknown Error'"},{"t":"text","text":", following the same convention as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftHttpClient"},{"t":"text","text":"; the original failure is available in the error payload's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"body"},{"t":"text","text":" field."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This means callers can handle connection loss through the normal Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exception path instead of adding a raw Promise rejection handler:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"result"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"getAnimals","kind":"function"},{"text":"({});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"if","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"isCraftException","kind":"function"},{"text":"(result) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"&&","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" result._tag ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"===","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'HttpError'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// show a retry action or an offline state","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same normalization is applied to custom transports registered with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"provideServerFunctionTransport(...)"},{"t":"text","text":". Business failures returned by the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server keep their own typed tags and are not converted to "},{"t":"code","text":"HttpError"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"public-function","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Public function"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"listPublicAnimals"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"serverFunction","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'animals.public-list'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  inputSchema,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { exposure: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'client'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", output: outputSchema },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":").","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"handler","kind":"function"},{"text":"(({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"input"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  Effect.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"gen","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"repository"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" AnimalRepository;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repository.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"list","kind":"function"},{"text":"(input.filter);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"protected-function","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Protected function"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reuse the same middleware mechanism for the protected path:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"listAdminAnimals"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"serverFunction","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'animals.admin-list'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  inputSchema,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { exposure: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'client'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", output: outputSchema },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":")","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  .","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"use","kind":"function"},{"text":"(requireAdminSession)","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  .","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"handler","kind":"function"},{"text":"(({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"input"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    Effect.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"gen","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"repository"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" AnimalRepository;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repository.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"listForAdmin","kind":"function"},{"text":"(input.filter);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  );","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"requireAdminSession"},{"t":"text","text":" is a "},{"t":"code","text":"craftMiddleware(...).server(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" value. It should"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"return an explicit authentication/authorization failure when there is no valid"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"session or the role is insufficient. The handler is then only responsible for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the business operation."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For middleware shared by many functions, the optional"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"createServerFunctionFactory([middleware])"},{"t":"text","text":" factory applies those existing"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":".use(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" calls in order; it does not introduce a new security policy API."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See the executable public/protected example in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"https://github.com/craft-ts/craft-ts/tree/main/apps/demo-with-server-function","external":true,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"apps/demo-with-server-function"}]},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"especially "},{"t":"code","text":"craftMiddleware"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"clientContext"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"craftHandshake"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":".use(...)"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Its server tests cover no session, a valid session and revocation. Keep the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server test beside the function so the middleware wiring remains visible."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The demo maps the two session failures to explicit 401 responses and maps a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","t